ine/godot/issues/101429","id":2587558525,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6aOwJ9","user":{"login":"Synzorasize","id":60207816,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMjA3ODE2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60207816?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize","html_url":"https://github.com/Synzorasize","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-13T16:14:21Z","updated_at":"2025-01-13T16:14:21Z","body":"I agree that the code is terrible and should probably be substituted with a template. I merely copy-pasted the code used for regular arrays and dictionaries since I wanted to set up the typed arrays and dictionaries up first. But now that I verified that the tests work, I think I should create templates for this.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2587558525/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":2,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2590103290","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101429#issuecomment-2590103290","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101429","id":2590103290,"node_id"